{
  "_comment": "Best-effort, UNVERIFIED vendor fingerprints for chat widgets. Patterns were written from general knowledge of public embed snippets and have NOT been checked against live widgets; vendors change hosts and markup without notice, so expect both missed widgets and false matches. A match shows a chat widget (possibly human-staffed) is likely present, not that it is an AI system. Every pattern is a case-insensitive regular expression source string. Patterns must stay free of nested quantifiers (checked at load).",
